     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Probably something like this?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">If you provide the actual dataset, I can also look at it..<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">--Kaori<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">#toy example<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">d &lt;- data.frame(group=1:3, A=c(1,2,3), B=c(-0.5,0.5,-2), C=c(1,1,1))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">#melt the data<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">d &lt;- melt(d, id.var = c(&quot;group&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">d$group &lt;- as.factor(d$group)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">d$variable &lt;- as.numeric(d$variable)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">ggplot(d, aes(x=variable, y=value, fill=group)) + \r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">geom_bar(stat=&quot;identity&quot;, position=&quot;dodge&quot;, alpha=0.5)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><img width=\"374\" height=\"338\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/b21042db513060af/image001.jpg?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jeremy.n...@gmail.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, April 24, 2013 12:29 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> plotting in ggplots2<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi guys!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have a question which I thought for sometime, but I&#39;m not sure how do I go about it.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Here&#39;s the graph I&#39;d like to get (I plotted it in excel, but I&#39;d very much prefer to want to keep all my work within R). <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-kJN8V-FqPwQ/UXgINUHwl9I/AAAAAAAAAAM/kOmIL20iJ80/s1600/sample.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-kJN8V-FqPwQ/UXgINUHwl9I/AAAAAAAAAAM/kOmIL20iJ80/s1600/sample.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372944233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mn6eM885gWxZwpJzFrD5P\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"170\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-kJN8V-FqPwQ/UXgINUHwl9I/AAAAAAAAAAM/kOmIL20iJ80/s320/sample.png\"></span></a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">How do I use ggplots to plot this bar graph? <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The dimension of the data frame which I get my data from is 3 rows and 45 columns (this one was cut off). <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Any leads will be much appreciated!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372944233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1U7kPnkS3OCDnIsiTnYJyH\">\r\nhttps://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372944233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1VzTmMwIpl2gU1XwgpDIkY\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggplot2&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372944233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WaGOwfyG2ri_wxHDyXMsT\">https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out</a>.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
